    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a high school student at No. 8 Middle School, and the graduation exam is now only 30 days away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you look around, you notice that there are strange anomalies in the classroom every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture these anomalies and record their number.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When recorded correctly, time will move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherwise, time will rewind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep trying until you pass these unusual 30 days and graduate successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sense of d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu in the high school classroom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic ambient noise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated replay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0A total of 40 anomalies.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a high school student at No. 8 Middle School, and the graduation exam is now only 30 days away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you look around, you notice that there are strange anomalies in the classroom every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture these anomalies and record their number.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When recorded correctly, time will move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherwise, time will rewind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep trying until you pass these unusual 30 days and graduate successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sense of d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu in the high school classroom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic ambient noise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated replay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0A total of 40 anomalies.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You've returned to your high school classroom, where time seems to stand still. You need to look around and find something unusual to get through the last 30 days of school.",
